{"id":532,"date":"2026-07-30T16:15:57","date_gmt":"2026-07-30T16:15:57","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/building-insights.org\/?page_id=532"},"modified":"2026-08-05T00:55:06","modified_gmt":"2026-08-05T00:55:06","slug":"about","status":"publish","type":"page","link":"https:\/\/building-insights.org\/about\/","title":{"rendered":"About"},"content":{"rendered":"\t\t<div data-elementor-type=\"wp-page\" data-elementor-id=\"532\" class=\"elementor elementor-532\" data-elementor-post-type=\"page\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-aee314e e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"aee314e\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-5a33331 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"5a33331\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">About Building Insights<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-f84bac4 elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"f84bac4\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Evidence, at the scale the built environment demands.<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-5ca37d8 elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"5ca37d8\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"hero-inner wrap\"><p>Building Insights Together Ltd generates the research, data, and practical tools that help governments, industry, and communities build a more sustainable future.<\/p><\/div>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-86e4efa e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"86e4efa\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" id=\"our-story\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-f6f1292 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"f6f1292\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;sticky&quot;:&quot;top&quot;,&quot;sticky_on&quot;:[&quot;desktop&quot;],&quot;sticky_offset&quot;:9,&quot;sticky_parent&quot;:&quot;yes&quot;,&quot;sticky_effects_offset&quot;:0,&quot;sticky_anchor_link_offset&quot;:0}\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-ec9052d elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"ec9052d\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Our Story<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-db0c397 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"db0c397\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Founded on a simple premise<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-1604933 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"1604933\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"lead\"><p>That better data leads to better buildings and better buildings lead to better lives.<\/p><\/div><div><div class=\"prose\">\u00a0<\/div><\/div>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-904f6dc e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"904f6dc\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-9b83e99 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"9b83e99\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Building Insights Together began as a small working group of researchers and practitioners who kept running into the same problem: governments and developers wanted to build more sustainably, but the evidence they needed to act with confidence was scattered, inconsistent, or locked away in academic journals no one outside a university would read.<\/p><p>So we set out to close that gap \u2014 translating\u00a0<strong>rigorous research<\/strong>\u00a0into\u00a0<strong>practical tools<\/strong>\u00a0that planning departments, contractors, and community boards could actually use. What started as a handful of pilot studies on energy performance has grown into a standing research and advisory practice working across the built environment, from retrofit policy to climate-resilient infrastructure.<\/p><p>We&#8217;re still the same organization at heart: a group that believes the built environment is one of the most powerful levers we have for social and environmental change \u2014 and that it deserves the same evidentiary rigor as public health or economic policy.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-306ac21 elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-blockquote--skin-border elementor-widget elementor-widget-blockquote\" data-id=\"306ac21\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"blockquote.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<blockquote class=\"elementor-blockquote\">\n\t\t\t<p class=\"elementor-blockquote__content\">\n\t\t\t\t\u201cWe generate the insights that shape a more sustainable built environment.\u201d\t\t\t<\/p>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/blockquote>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-e725822 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"e725822\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" id=\"our-why\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-7c34f63 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"7c34f63\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">WHY WE EXIST<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-379a477 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"379a477\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">The Numbers That Set Our Agenda<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-37de8fd elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"37de8fd\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit. Ut elit tellus, luctus nec ullamcorper mattis, pulvinar dapibus leo.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-a61403f elementor-widget-divider--view-line elementor-widget elementor-widget-divider\" data-id=\"a61403f\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"divider.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-divider\">\n\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-divider-separator\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/span>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-b457bed e-grid e-con-full e-con e-child\" data-id=\"b457bed\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-