t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-q-footer\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<cite class=\"elementor-blockquote__author\">We exist to make sure they make it with evidence in hand.<\/cite>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/blockquote>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-814ac31 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"814ac31\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"p1\">Sources: UNEP Global Status Report for Buildings and Construction (2024\/2025 and 2025\/2026); UN DESA, World Urbanization Prospects.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-3145871 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"3145871\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" id=\"governance\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-e8ccc5a e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"e8ccc5a\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-69bb891 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"69bb891\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Governance &amp; Approach\n\n\n<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-6fac17a elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"6fac17a\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">How We Work, And What Keeps Us Honest\n<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-c8eb478 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"c8eb478\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-8db02ff elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"8db02ff\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"lead\"><div class=\"split split--intro reveal in\"><div class=\"split split--intro reveal in\"><div><p class=\"lede\">Building Insights Together is committed to achieving its objectives through responsible actions, measurable progress and continuous improvement. Four principles govern every project we take on \u2014 select any one to see what it means in practice.<\/p><\/div><\/div><\/div><figure class=\"graphic reveal in\"><\/figure><\/div>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-bb0a3a9 e-grid e-con-full e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"bb0a3a9\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-2070d29 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"2070d29\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-78df432 elementor-view-default elementor-position-block-start elementor-mobile-position-block-start elementor-widget elementor-widget-icon-box\" data-id=\"78df432\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"icon-box.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-icon-box-wrapper\">\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-icon-box-icon\">\n\t\t\t\t<span  class=\"elementor-icon\">\n\t\t\t\t<svg xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 48 48\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"approach 01 rigorous research\"><g fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#0B