=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 48 48\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"ui toggle plus\"><circle cx=\"24\" cy=\"24\" r=\"22\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#CEDAE5\" stroke-width=\"2\"><\/circle><line x1=\"15\" y1=\"24\" x2=\"33\" y2=\"24\" stroke=\"#0B1F33\" stroke-width=\"2\"><\/line><line x1=\"24\" y1=\"15\" x2=\"24\" y2=\"33\" stroke=\"#0B1F33\" stroke-width=\"2\"><\/line><\/svg><\/span>\n\t\t<\/span>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/summary>\n\t\t\t\t<div role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"e-n-accordion-item-8600\" class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-fae3c44 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"fae3c44\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-3dc38c1 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"3dc38c1\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>We declare our methods before we start and retain the underlying data afterwards, so any finding we publish can be checked by someone who did not produce it.<\/p><ul><li>Internationally recognised measurement and reporting standards<\/li><li>Primary data collection wherever secondary data cannot be verified<\/li><li>Assumptions and limitations stated on the face of every output<\/li><li>Findings published whether or not they suit the commissioning party<\/li><\/ul>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/details>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-36d3999 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"36d3999\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-622e3e2 elementor-view-default elementor-position-block-start elementor-mobile-position-block-start elementor-widget elementor-widget-icon-box\" data-id=\"622e3e2\" data-ele