<\/div><\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class='e-n-accordion-item-title-icon'>\n\t\t\t<span class='e-opened' ><svg xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 48 48\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"ui toggle minus\"><circle cx=\"24\" cy=\"24\" r=\"23\" fill=\"#0B1F33\"><\/circle><line x1=\"15\" y1=\"24\" x2=\"33\" y2=\"24\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"2\"><\/line><\/svg><\/span>\n\t\t\t<span class='e-closed'><svg xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 48 48\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"ui toggle plus\"><circle cx=\"24\" cy=\"24\" r=\"22\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#CEDAE5\" stroke-width=\"2\"><\/circle><line x1=\"15\" y1=\"24\" x2=\"33\" y2=\"24\" stroke=\"#0B1F33\" stroke-width=\"2\"><\/line><line x1=\"24\" y1=\"15\" x2=\"24\" y2=\"33\" stroke=\"#0B1F33\" stroke-width=\"2\"><\/line><\/svg><\/span>\n\t\t<\/span>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/summary>\n\t\t\t\t<div role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"e-n-accordion-item-1040\" class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-a22dd14 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"a22dd14\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-b1123da elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"b1123da\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>The evidence gap is too wide for any one organisation to close. We build long-term working relationships rather than one-off commissions, and we name our funders on the work they funded.<\/p><ul><li>Joint research programmes with universities and research institutes<\/li><li>Advisory work with public bodies and international organisations<\/li><li>Every engagement screened for conflict of interest before it begins<\/li><li>Community and civil society partners involved from design, not at review<\/li><\/ul>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/details>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<