dion_animation_duration&quot;:{&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;ms&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:400,&quot;sizes&quot;:[]}}\" data-widget_type=\"nested-accordion.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-n-accordion\" aria-label=\"Accordion. Open links with Enter or Space, close with Escape, and navigate with Arrow Keys\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<details id=\"e-n-accordion-item-4040\" class=\"e-n-accordion-item\" >\n\t\t\t\t<summary class=\"e-n-accordion-item-title\" data-accordion-index=\"1\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"e-n-accordion-item-4040\" >\n\t\t\t\t\t<span class='e-n-accordion-item-title-header'><div class=\"e-n-accordion-item-title-text\"> Sharing our knowledge and insights to maximise the reach and usefulness of our research. <\/div><\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class='e-n-accordion-item-title-icon'>\n\t\t\t<span class='e-opened' ><svg xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 48 48\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"ui toggle minus\"><circle cx=\"24\" cy=\"24\" r=\"23\" fill=\"#0B1F33\"><\/circle><line x1=\"15\" y1=\"24\" x2=\"33\" y2=\"24\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"2\"><\/line><\/svg><\/span>\n\t\t\t<span class='e-closed'><svg xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 48 48\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"ui toggle plus\"><circle cx=\"24\" cy=\"24\" r=\"22\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#CEDAE5\" stroke-width=\"2\"><\/circle><line x1=\"15\" y1=\"24\" x2=\"33\" y2=\"24\" stroke=\"#0B1F33\" stroke-width=\"2\"><\/line><line x1=\"24\" y1=\"15\" x2=\"24\" y2=\"33\" stroke=\"#0B1F33\" stroke-width=\"2\"><\/line><\/svg><\/span>\n\t\t<\/span>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/summary>\n\t\t\t\t<div role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"e-n-accordion-item-4040\" class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-9242685 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"9242685\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-88055dc elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"88055dc\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"card\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><div><p>Research that sits behind a paywall cannot change a decision. We publish openly by default and translate findings into the format the audience actually uses.<\/p><ul><li>Open-access publication as the standard, not the exception<\/li><li>Tools, datasets and calculators released for public use<\/li><li>Plain-language summaries alongside every technical report<\/li><li>Training and capacity building for the teams applying the work<\/li><\/ul><\/div><\/div>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/details>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-d11a22a e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"d11a22a\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4eb2003 elementor-view-default elementor-position-block-start elementor-mobile-position-block-start elementor-widget elementor-widget-icon-box\" data-id=\"4eb2003\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"icon-box.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-icon-box-wrapper\">\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-icon-box-icon\">\n\t\t\t\t<span  class=\"elementor-icon\">\n\t\t\t\t<svg xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 48 48\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"approach 04 responsible innovation\"><g fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#0B1F33\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M24 6l14 6v10c0 9-6 16.5-14 20-8-3.5-14-11-14-20V12z\"><\/path><path d=\"M17.5 23.5l5 5 9-10\"><\/path><\/g><\/svg>\t\t\t\t<\/span>\n\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-icon-box-content\">\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"elementor-icon-box-title\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span  >\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tResponsible Innovation\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/h3>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-d2f4c6a elementor-widget elementor-widget-n-accordion\" data-id=\"d2f4c6a\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-settings=\"{&quot;default_state&quot;:&quot;all_collapsed&quot;,&quot;max_items_expended&quot;:&quot;one&quot;,&quot;n_accordion_animation_duration&quot;:{&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;ms&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:400,&quot;sizes&quot;:[]}}\" data-widget_type=\"nested-accordion.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-n-accordion\" aria-label=\"Accordion. Open links with Enter or Space, close with Escape, and navigate with Arrow Keys\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<details id=\"e-n-accordion-item-2210\" class=\"e-n-accordion-item\" >\n\t\t\t\t<summary class=\"e-n-accordion-item-title\" data-accordion-index=\"1\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"e-n-accordion-item-2210\" >\n\t\t\t\t\t<span class='e-n-accordion-item-title-header'><div class=\"e-n-accordion-item-title-text\"> Ensuring new tools and analytical approaches are developed with transparency, integrity and sustainability in mind. <\/div><\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class='e-n-accordion-item-title-icon'>\n\t\t\t<span class='e-opened' ><svg xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 48 48\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"ui toggle minus\"><circle cx=\"24\" cy=\"24\" r=\"23\" fill=\"#0B1F33\"><\/circle><line x1=\"15\" y1=\"24\" x2=\"33\" y2=\"24\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"2\"><\/line><\/svg><\/span>\n\t\t\t<span class='e-closed'><svg xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 48 48\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"ui toggle plus\"><circle cx=\"24\" cy=\"24\" r=\"22\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#CEDAE5\" stroke-width=\"2\"><\/circle><line x1=\"15\" y1=\"24\" x2=\"33\" y2=\"24\" stroke=\"#0B1F33\" stroke-width=\"2\"><\/line><line x1=\"24\" y1=\"15\" x2=\"24\" y2=\"33\" stroke=\"#0B1F33\" stroke-width=\"2\"><\/line><\/svg><\/span>\n\t\t<\/span>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/summary>\n\t\t\t\t<div role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"e-n-accordion-item-2210\" class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-46ffdd8 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"46ffdd8\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-146b06c elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"146b06c\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"card\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><p>New methods earn their place by being testable. Anything we build \u2014 model, tool or index \u2014 ships with its assumptions visible and its failure modes documented.<\/p><ul><li>Models validated against measured outcomes before release<\/li><li>Documented limitations, uncertainty ranges and appropriate use<\/li><li>Data handled to recognised privacy and security standards<\/li><li>Our own operational footprint held to the standard we recommend<\/li><\/ul><\/div>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/details>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-47fdfbf e-con-full e-flex e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"47fdfbf\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" id=\"mission-vision\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-b242b45 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"b242b45\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Mission &amp; Vision\n\n<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-44b6b0c elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"44b6b0c\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Building a Better Future<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-7900516 elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"7900516\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p data-start=\"123\" data-end=\"310\">We&#8217;re committed to shaping a built environment that supports people, strengthens communities, and creates lasting environmental, social, and economic impact through evidence-based action.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-97b33b6 e-grid e-con-full e-con e-child\" data-id=\"97b33b6\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-dd9f158 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"dd9f158\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-e56418e elementor-view-default elementor-widget elementor-widget-icon\" data-id=\"e56418e\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"icon.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-icon-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-icon\">\n\t\t\t<svg xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 48 48\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"mission target\"><g fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><circle cx=\"24\" cy=\"24\" r=\"18\"><\/circle><circle cx=\"24\" cy=\"24\" r=\"10\"><\/circle><\/g><circle cx=\"24\" cy=\"24\" r=\"2.5\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"><\/circle><\/svg>\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-796f4f5 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"796f4f5\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Our Mission\n\n<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-c1f79a0 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"c1f79a0\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">To build understanding, generate insights and knowledge, and create tools that help society design and deliver a more sustainable built environment.<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-456cbfd elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"456cbfd\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<article class=\"mv__card mv__card--ink\"><p>We combine rigorous research, evidence-based analysis and strategic collaboration to help governments, industry and communities make better decisions. Turning complex data into practical knowledge and tools is not a by-product of the work. It is the work.<\/p><\/article>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-1a0f743 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"1a0f743\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-3753116 elementor-view-default elementor-widget elementor-widget-icon\" data-id=\"3753116\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"icon.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-icon-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-icon\">\n\t\t\t<svg xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 48 48\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"mission target\"><g fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#0B1F33\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><circle cx=\"24\" cy=\"24\" r=\"18\"><\/circle><circle cx=\"24\" cy=\"24\" r=\"10\"><\/circle><\/g><circle cx=\"24\" cy=\"24\" r=\"2.5\" fill=\"#0B1F33\"><\/circle><\/svg>\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-9edf7af elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"9edf7af\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Our Mission\n\n<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-b00da66 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"b00da66\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">A more sustainable, resilient, and inclusive built environment begins with informed decisions backed by credible evidence.<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-9b39572 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"9b39572\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<article class=\"mv__card mv__card--ink\"><section id=\"mission\" class=\"tint\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"mv reveal in\"><article class=\"mv__card mv__card--light\"><p>The choices we make today shape the communities of tomorrow. Building Insights works with organizations and communities to provide transparent research and practical strategies that create lasting environmental and social impact.<\/p><\/article><\/div><\/div><\/section><section id=\"impact\" class=\"paper\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"split split--intro reveal in\"><div>\u00a0<\/div><\/div><